			"notes": "### Added\n\n- Extra and regular Hostile neural network integration: now you can read information from data models\n- Extra and regular Hostile neural network integration: now you can configure loot fabricators as peripherals\n\n### Re-release: client deserialization fix\n\nRebuilt from `024061dbf92354407942e2dcbd1f3ef9b8622199` after merging #108 (fixes #107). Fixes Display Pedestal client disconnects during chunk synchronization on Fabric and NeoForge, and preserves registry-backed item components in related block-entity storage.\n\nThe Minecraft 1.21.1 Fabric and NeoForge JARs have been replaced while retaining version 1.9.1. Re-download this release if you installed the earlier assets; their SHA-256 checksums have changed. The Minecraft 1.20.1 release is unchanged."
